"Titanium Dioxide – L'Aprochimide Srl (https://aprochimide.it/titanium-dioxide/?lang=en)\nciteturn77view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://aprochimide.it/titanium-dioxide/?lang=en\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 306\nL0:   * Telefono: +39 039 271 61 mailbox@aprochimide.it\nL1: \nL2:   * cite0†English L3:     * cite1†English L4:     * cite2†Italiano L5: \nL6:   * Tel. +39 039 271 61 mailbox@aprochimide.it\nL7: \nL8: cite3†Image L9: \nL10: ## Titanium Dioxide\nL11: ## types: Atanase and Rutilo\nL12: \nL13: Titanium dioxide is the most important and most common inorganic pigment with global sales of approx. 6.5 million tons per year. It has the highest hiding power and dispersibility and is used in the production of paints and varnishes, coatings and plastic materials, in paper, leather, rubber, enamel, ceramics, food, cosmetics, pharmaceuticals, fibers and in various other sectors.\nL14: TITANIUM DIOXIDE ANATASE\nL15: TITANIUM DIOXIDE RUTILO\nL16: PHOTOCATALIC TITANIUM DIOXIDE\nL17: COSMETIC TITANIUM DIOXIDE\nL18: TITANIUM DIOXIDE UV FILTER\nL19: \nL20: BRAND REPRESENTED\nL21: \nL22: cite4†Image L23: ## Market and Applications\nL24: \nL25: Some applications of the titanium dioxide distributed by L’Aprochimide.\nL26: \nL27: cite5†FOOD L28: \nL29: cite6†TANNING AND AUXILIARIES L30: \nL31: cite7†TEXTILE AUXILIARIES L32: \nL33: cite8†PAPER L34: \nL35: cite9†CERAMIC L36: \nL37: cite10†COSMETIC L38: \nL39: cite11†CEMENT AND ASPHALT BUILDING L40: \nL41: cite12†PHARMACEUTICAL L42: \nL43: cite13†GUM L44: \nL45: cite14†CHEMICAL INDUSTRY L46: \nL47: cite15†PAINTS AND VARNISHES L48: \nL49: cite16†PLASTIC, RESINS AND POLYMERS L50: \nL51: cite17†ROAD SIGNS L52: ## Contact us for informations\nL53: \nL54: [Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input]\nL55: \nL56: Nome\nL57: [Input]\nL58: \nL59: Email\nL60: [Input]\nL61: \nL62: Oggetto\nL63: [Input]\nL64: \nL65: Mes